   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of providing support to Compartamos Financiera S.A. (&#x201c;Compartamos&#x201d; or the &#x201c;Financial Institution&#x201d;), in the issuance of its first program of senior social bonds. The total amount of the issuance will be in Soles (&#x201c;PEN&#x201d;) up to an equivalent of US$40 million, composed as follows: (i) an investment by IDB Invest for an amount of up to US$20 million; and (ii) an amount mobilized with another co-investor of up to US$20 million. The transaction will have a term of up to three years and amortization with payment at maturity (bullet). The financing aims to expand the Micro and Small Enterprises&#xb4; portfolio (&#x201c;MSEs&#x201d;) and MSEs led and/or owned by women; and other vulnerable groups.</narrative>
  </description>
